Common ContactResponsibility
    documentation "The contact responsibility for the student, effective beginning on a specific date."
    domain entity Contact
        documentation "Describes the relation of the contact to their responsibility"
        is part of identity
    descriptor ContactResponsibility
        documentation "Defines the type of responsibility a contact has for a specific student."
        is part of identity
    date ContactResponsibilityBeginDate
        documentation "The date on which the specific contact responsibility for the student becomes effective. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is part of identity
    date ContactResponsibilityEndDate
        documentation "The date on which the specific contact responsibility for the student ends. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional